    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2014474621471621398",
      "url": "https://x.com/nabunturanguy/status/2014474621471621398",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/nabunturanguy/status/2014474621471621398",
      "text": "At ayun na nga! We had lunch with balikbayans. And a friend beside me, suddenly blurted out, “Oy, number one na ang Davao city sa worst traffic in the country. Mas malala pa sa metro Manila.” Almost in unison, the two commented, “Naku fake news yan. Wag kayong maniwala.  Kaya kami hindi na nanonood diyan sa GMA.” Muntik ko nang mailuwa ang chicken cordon bleu with glazed sweet potatoes (sorry, di ako kumakain ng pork pochero with sweet sweet cardava banana). Tumahimik na lang kami.  We don’t want to offend guests, as a matter of habit. But, they? Walang pakialam ang mga lintek. Akala mo kung sinong mga “know-it-all.”",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
